# No packages.
#
# A br2-external tree must have a Config.in, and this one has nothing to put in
# it: the tree exists to carry build fixes against the pinned buildroot
# (external.mk), not to add packages. Everything this repo installs into an
# image arrives through BR2_ROOTFS_OVERLAY instead
# (image/buildroot/tailnet-overlay.sh), which is the mechanism for files rather
# than for recipes.
#
# When a package does become necessary, it goes in package/<name>/ beside this
# file and is sourced from here. Not before: an empty menu in menuconfig is one
# more thing that looks like it does something.
